{"title":"2000 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><dl><dd><i>The following problem is from the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_CEMC_Pascal_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2000 CEMC Pascal Problems (page does not exist)\">2000 CEMC Pascal #2</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_CEMC_Fermat_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2000 CEMC Fermat Problems (page does not exist)\">2000 CEMC Fermat #1</a>, so those problems redirect to this page.</i></dd></dl>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The sum of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/6/2/162a89855ae086bbc9f2436dd25cfc7b41d26148.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$29 + 12 + 23$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"101\" height=\"15\" /> is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/0/e/10e93523d1126ac74e29660b05bcb4c1882ad9ea.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{ (A) }\\ 32^2 \\qquad\\text{ (B) }\\ 2^6 \\qquad\\text{ (C) }\\ 3^4 \\qquad\\text{ (D) }\\ 1^{64} \\qquad\\text{ (E) }\\ 64^0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"450\" height=\"21\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Evaluating the sum, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/a/3/da33978fed16c0c93322fe8bfbeb5efac5322e09.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$29 + 12 + 23 = 41 + 23 = 64$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"226\" height=\"15\" />.\n</p><p>We now want to find what each of the answer choices are equal to until we get an answer that is equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/5/e/05e228ac5bee7b9ffb60cacf50f3f2c7c31f8038.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$64$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"18\" height=\"13\" />.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/a/f8a85557b34a44f4ca4feb3dfb565ede731cff63.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$32^2 = 1024$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"86\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/9/0/a901d5103f4658787ce321610aa348a76ea79fb9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^6 = 64$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"61\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p>This means that the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/d/dcdf73f858fc5a14f4fb09b34c1d42a9627051bd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed {\\textbf {(B) } 2^6}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"64\" height=\"32\" />.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_on_Fermat\">Problem on Fermat</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Problem on Fermat\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>This problem appears as the first on <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_CEMC_Fermat\" title=\"2000 CEMC Fermat\">2000 CEMC Fermat</a> but with different answer choices:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/6/1/86109b94191b16ef658479050af61c9038940020.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{ (A) }\\ 6^2 \\qquad\\text{ (B) }\\ 4^4 \\qquad\\text{ (C) }\\ 8^8 \\qquad\\text{ (D) }\\ 64^0 \\qquad\\text{ (E) }\\ 2^6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"434\" height=\"21\" />\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_CEMC_Pascal\" title=\"2000 CEMC Pascal\">2000 CEMC Pascal</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_CEMC_Pascal_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2000 CEMC Pascal Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_CEMC_Pascal_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2000 CEMC Pascal Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2000 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 1\">Problem 1</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2000 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2000 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2000 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2000 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2000 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2000 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Probl